 112:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     and the Callback ID.
 113:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     This function allows to reset following callbacks:
